{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49256","headline":"河传 三 · 温庭筠","name":"河传 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"同伴，相唤。\n杏花稀，梦里每愁依违。\n仙客一去燕已飞，不归，泪痕空满衣。\n天际云鸟引情远，春已晚，烟霭渡南苑。\n雪梅香，柳带长，小娘，转令人意伤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49256.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49256","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}